-memory","phrase":"五三周总见印度，首次提五项","meaning":"1953年12月周恩来接见印度代表团时首次提出和平共处五项原则。","targetIds":["cs-target-peaceful-proposal"],"coverageType":"peaceful-proposal","conditionRefs":[],"refs":[{"pointId":"new-china-reform","tabId":"peaceful-coexistence","sourceUnitIds":["cs-1-9-p23-peaceful-coexistence-list"],"fingerprint":"74d884b4","label":"中华人民共和国成立和社会主义建设 · 和平共处五项原则","auditStatus":"ready-for-user-acceptance"}],"questionIds":["peaceful-proposal-core","new-china-diplomacy-full"],"checks":[{"questionId":"peaceful-proposal-core","checkPurpose":"peaceful-proposal","reviewTarget":"phrase","reviewAnchorId":"cs-target-peaceful-proposal-memory"},{"questionId":"new-china-diplomacy-full","checkPurpose":"full-recheck","reviewTarget":"meaning","reviewAnchorId":"cs-target-peaceful-proposal-memory"}]},{"id":"cs-target-peaceful-content-memory","phrase":"尊主权、互不犯、不干政、平互利、和共处","meaning":"五项原则包括互相尊重主权和领土完整、互不侵犯、互不干涉内政、平等互利、和平共处；1955年万隆会议发展为十项原则。","targetIds":["cs-target-peaceful-content"],"coverageType":"peaceful-content","conditionRefs":[],"refs":[{"pointId":"new-china-reform","tabId":"peaceful-coexistence","sourceUnitIds":["cs-1-9-p23-peaceful-coexistence-list"],"fingerprint":"74d884b4","label":"中华人民共和国成立和社会主义建设 · 和平共处五项原则","auditStatus":"ready-for-user-acceptance"}],"questionIds":["peaceful-content-core","new-china-diplomacy-full"],"checks":[{"questionId":"peaceful-content-core","checkPurpose":"peaceful-content","reviewTarget":"phrase","reviewAnchorId":"cs-target-peaceful-content-memory"},{"questionId":"new-china-diplomacy-full","checkPurpose":"full-recheck","reviewTarget":"meaning","reviewAnchorId":"cs-target-peaceful-content-memory"}]},{"id":"cs-target-un-seat-restoration-memory","phrase":"七一二六大会复席位","meaning":"1971年10月25日，第26届联合国大会恢复中华人民共和国在联合国的一切合法权利，包括安理会常任理事国席位。","targetIds":["cs-target-un-seat-restoration"],"coverageType":"un-seat","conditionRefs":[],"refs":[{"pointId":"new-china-reform","tabId":"un-seat-restoration","sourceUnitIds":["cs-1-9-p24-un-seat-restoration-list"],"finger